ss="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/frederick-i-elector-palatine"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/frederick-i-elector-palatine.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Frederick I, Elector Palatine</span><span class="enc-type">Person</span><span class="enc-snip">Frederick I, Elector Palatine, called the Victorious, governed the Palatinate from 1451 as guardian of his nephew and then as elector in his own right.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/frederick-i-grand-duke-of-baden"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/frederick-i-grand-duke-of-baden.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Frederick I, Grand Duke of Baden</span><span class="enc-type">Person</span><span class="enc-snip">Frederick I ruled Baden as regent from 1852 and as grand duke from 1856 until his death.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/frederick-i-landgrave-of-hesse-homburg"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/frederick-i-landgrave-of-hesse-homburg.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Frederick I, Landgrave of Hesse-Homburg</span><span class="enc-type">Person</span><span class="enc-snip">Frederick I was the youngest son of Landgrave George I of Hesse-Darmstadt.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item"><a href="/encyclopedia/frederick-ii"><span class="enc-name">Frederick II</span><span class="enc-type">Person</span><span class="enc-snip">Frederick II was Holy Roman Emperor and King of Sicily in the thirteenth century.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/frederick-ii-of-denmark"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/frederick-ii-of-denmark.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Frederick II of Denmark</span><span class="enc-type">Person</span><span class="enc-snip">Frederick II was king of Denmark and Norway from 1559.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/frederick-ii-of-legnica"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/frederick-ii-of-legnica.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Frederick II of Legnica</span><span class="enc-type">Person</span><span class="enc-snip">Frederick II of Legnica was a Silesian Piast duke who ruled Legnica and from 1521 also Brzeg.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/frederick-ii-elector-of-brandenburg"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/frederick-ii-elector-of-brandenburg.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Frederick II, Elector of Brandenburg</span><span class="enc-type">Person</span><span class="enc-snip">Frederick II, called Irontooth, was Elector of Brandenburg from 1440 to 1470, son of Frederick I.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/frederick-ii-grand-duke-of-baden"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/frederick-ii-grand-duke-of-baden.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Frederick II, Grand Duke of Baden</span><span class="enc-type">Person</span><span class="enc-snip">Frederick II was the last Grand Duke of Baden, reigning from 1907 to 1918, the son of Frederick I and a grandson of Emperor William I.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/frederick-iii-of-denmark"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/frederick-iii-of-denmark.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Frederick III of Denmark</span><span class="enc-type">Person</span><span class="enc-snip">Frederick III was king of Denmark and Norway from 1648 to 1670.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item"><a href="/encyclopedia/frederick-iii-of-nuremberg"><span class="enc-name">Frederick III of Nuremberg</span><span class="enc-type">Person</spa